OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and bright initially, but
OL,6,Fbecoming cloudy and breezy through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Outbreaks of rain will soon
OL,8,Fdevelop, turning heavy for a time
OL,9,Fbefore clearing eastwards by late
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and mostly clear night
OL,13,Fwith winds gradually easing. It will
OL,14,Fturn chilly, with mist and grass frost
OL,15,Flikely in rural areas.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FAny mist will soon clear to
OL,18,Fleave a fine day with light winds and
OL,19,Flong sunny periods, perhaps hazy at
OL,20,Ftimes. Feeling pleasantly warm in the
OL,21,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
