OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fand rather cloudy on Tuesday. Heavy
OL,7,Frain followed by blustery showers on
OL,8,FWednesday. Sunny spells with the odd
OL,9,Fshower on Thursday. Above average
OL,10,Fdaytime temperatures though cooler by
OL,11,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
